text.en:
Drop the low bit, shift the rest up, and append `din`:

```vhdl
if reset = '1' then
    r <= (others => '0');
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    r <= r(6 downto 0) & din;
end if;
-- q <= r; concurrently
```

text.es:
Descarta el bit alto, sube el resto y añade `din` al final:

```vhdl
if reset = '1' then
    r <= (others => '0');
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    r <= r(6 downto 0) & din;
end if;
-- q <= r; de forma concurrente
```
